<title>USA: Housecall names Daniel Kohl president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Housecall names Daniel Kohl president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Housecall Medical Resources Inc said Tuesday it named Daniel J. Kohl president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Kohl, 40, will assume his duties immediately and will replace George Shaunnessy, who is leaving the company due to personal and family obligations, Housecall said.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Housecall, Kohl was senior vice president and group executive of Equifax Inc.</p>
</text>
